WEBVTT

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:11.950
别动。
Don't move.

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:17.300
告诉我……
Tell me...

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:19.100
你到底是从哪里来的？
Where did you come from?

00:00:20.301 --> 00:00:22.601
她：（不挣开）我是楼上宴会的摄影师。你的眼睛怎么回事？
Her: (Doesn't pull away.) I'm the photographer for the party upstairs. What's wrong with your eyes?
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 1 轮 · Realtime round 1）

00:00:22.701 --> 00:00:25.029
她：我是楼上的摄影师。你的眼睛怎么回事？
I'm a photographer upstairs. Your eyes?

00:00:25.229 --> 00:00:27.557
眼睛？那是你害的。
The eyes? That's your doing.

00:00:27.757 --> 00:00:30.069
待着。
Stay.

00:00:30.269 --> 00:00:32.581
Harland把订婚提前了，还有十分钟。
Harland moved the engagement up. Ten minutes.

00:00:37.905 --> 00:00:40.205
她：什么叫我害的？你把话说清楚。
Her: What do you mean, I caused this? Explain yourself.
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 2 轮 · Realtime round 2）

00:00:40.305 --> 00:00:42.633
她：说清楚，现在。
Explain what you mean. Now.

00:00:42.833 --> 00:00:45.161
是你的气味。
It's your scent.

00:00:47.873 --> 00:00:50.185
原来你在这里。Mate。
There you are. Mate.

00:00:52.897 --> 00:00:55.209
跟我走。
Come with me.

00:00:55.509 --> 00:00:57.809
她：Mate是什么意思？我凭什么跟你走？
Her: What does Mate mean? Why should I go with you?
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 3 轮 · Realtime round 3）

00:00:57.909 --> 00:01:00.237
她：Mate是什么意思？
What does Mate mean?

00:01:00.437 --> 00:01:02.765
一头狼，一生一个。是你。
One wolf. One life. You.

00:01:02.965 --> 00:01:04.775
现在我身上全是你的气味。
Your scent is on me now.

00:01:11.003 --> 00:01:12.813
在我的庄园里，没人能碰你。
At my estate, no one touches you.

00:01:13.113 --> 00:01:15.413
她：我把手覆上他的拳头。
Her: I lay my hand over his fist.
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 4 轮 · Realtime round 4）

00:01:18.041 --> 00:01:20.369
你不怕。
You're not afraid.

00:01:23.081 --> 00:01:25.393
让他们找。
Let them look.

00:01:25.593 --> 00:01:27.905
现在，他们会来找你了。
They'll come looking for you now.

00:01:30.717 --> 00:01:33.017
她：那震动声是什么？是不是有人追来了？
Her: What's that rumbling? Is someone coming after us?
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 5 轮 · Realtime round 5）

00:01:33.117 --> 00:01:35.445
她：她：是不是有人追来了？
Is someone coming for us?

00:01:35.645 --> 00:01:37.973
他：有人在找我。
Someone looking for me.

00:01:38.173 --> 00:01:40.485
他：现在，他们会来找你了。
They'll come for you now.

00:01:45.709 --> 00:01:48.021
他：让他们来。
Let them.

00:01:48.321 --> 00:01:50.621
她：未婚妻在找你。那你到底选她还是选我？
Her: Your fiancée is looking for you. So who do you choose, her or me?
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 6 轮 · Realtime round 6）

00:01:50.721 --> 00:01:53.049
她：她：选她，还是选我？
Her or me?

00:01:53.249 --> 00:01:55.577
他：你。只有你。
You. Only you.

00:01:55.777 --> 00:01:58.089
我闻到你气味的那一刻，就已经选了。
I chose the moment I caught your scent.

00:02:03.313 --> 00:02:05.625
你们的世界里，只在故事里听过的东西。
Something your world only tells stories about.

00:02:05.925 --> 00:02:08.225
她：我走近他，问订婚的事。
Her: I walk up to him and ask about the engagement.
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 7 轮 · Realtime round 7）

00:02:08.325 --> 00:02:10.653
她：你的订婚……现在怎么办？
Your engagement. What happens now?

00:02:10.853 --> 00:02:13.181
我走了。
I walked out on it.

00:02:13.381 --> 00:02:16.530
闻到你气味的那一刻，我就走了。
I walked out the moment I caught your scent.

00:02:20.080 --> 00:02:23.229
你在发抖。
You're shaking.

00:02:23.529 --> 00:02:25.829
她：我冷。你的庄园有热的东西喝吗？给我倒杯酒。
Her: I'm cold. Does your manor have anything hot to drink? Pour me a glass of wine.
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 8 轮 · Realtime round 8）

00:02:25.929 --> 00:02:28.257
她：我冷。给我倒杯酒。
I'm cold. Pour me a drink.

00:02:28.457 --> 00:02:30.785
坐下。我去拿。
Sit. I'll bring it.

00:02:33.497 --> 00:02:35.809
喝吧。会暖和起来。
Drink. It'll warm you.

00:02:41.133 --> 00:02:43.433
她：谁在敲门？是不是你的未婚妻追来了？
Her: Who's knocking? Did your fiancée follow you here?
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 9 轮 · Realtime round 9）

00:02:43.533 --> 00:02:45.861
她：是你的未婚妻吗？
Is it your fiancée?

00:02:46.061 --> 00:02:48.389
Selene。待在我身后。
Selene. Stay behind me.

00:02:51.101 --> 00:02:53.413
Arkwright小姐，他今晚不见任何人。
Miss Arkwright, he's not receiving anyone.

00:02:53.613 --> 00:02:55.925
一个人类，Magnus？满月之前，长老会会把她带走。
A human, Magnus? The Council will have her before the full moon.

00:02:58.737 --> 00:03:01.037
她：我走到他面前，抚上他的脸
Her: I walk up to him and touch his face.
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 10 轮 · Realtime round 10）

00:03:01.137 --> 00:03:03.465
她：我不是在怕你。
I'm not afraid of you.

00:03:03.665 --> 00:03:05.993
那是什么？
Then what is it?

00:03:11.217 --> 00:03:13.529
今晚，留在我身边。
Stay with me. Just tonight.

00:03:16.341 --> 00:03:18.641
她：好，我留下来。但你得陪我坐下，别再躲着我。
Her: Fine, I'll stay. But you have to sit with me and stop avoiding me.
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 11 轮 · Realtime round 11）

00:03:18.741 --> 00:03:21.069
她：我留下。陪我坐下。
I'll stay. Sit with me.

00:03:21.269 --> 00:03:23.597
那我不再躲了。
Then I'm done hiding.

00:03:26.309 --> 00:03:28.621
再说一遍。
Say it again.

00:03:31.333 --> 00:03:33.645
我等这一刻等了三十年。
I waited thirty years for this.

00:03:33.945 --> 00:03:36.245
她：狼嚎是怎么回事？你们的人会来吗？
Her: What's with the howling? Will your people come?
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 12 轮 · Realtime round 12）

00:03:36.345 --> 00:03:38.673
她：狼嚎是怎么回事？
What was that howl?

00:03:38.873 --> 00:03:41.201
他们知道你在这里。
They know you're here.

00:03:46.425 --> 00:03:47.900
留下。没人能碰你。
Stay. They won't touch you.

00:03:51.549 --> 00:03:53.849
她：我走下石阶，迎向松林
Her: I walk down the stone steps toward the pine forest.
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 13 轮 · Realtime round 13）

00:03:53.949 --> 00:03:56.277
她：我想见见他们。
I want to see them.

00:03:56.477 --> 00:03:58.805
别离开我的视线。
Stay within my sight.

00:04:03.024 --> 00:04:04.834
它们回应你了。
They answered you.

00:04:05.034 --> 00:04:06.843
Alpha，Harland召集了长老，就在今晚。
Alpha. Harland has called the elders. Tonight.

00:04:09.153 --> 00:04:11.453
她：先别去长老会。这些眼睛是谁？我要看清楚。
Her: Don't go to the Elders yet. Whose eyes are these? I want to see clearly.
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 14 轮 · Realtime round 14）

00:04:11.553 --> 00:04:13.881
她：这些眼睛是谁？
Who are those eyes?

00:04:14.081 --> 00:04:16.409
看。别怕他们。
Look. Don't fear them.

00:04:22.638 --> 00:04:24.447
我的族人。他们是来看你的。
My pack. They came for you.
